    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiss &amp; Hunt</strong> is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer snake game with pixel art visuals, where you control a hungry snake in a chaotic arena. Every piece of food you eat makes your snake grow, increasing both your reach and the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>speed boost</strong> to escape danger or grab food before your opponents. There\u2019s no penalty for boosting, so feel free to use it as much as you want! But be cautious: if you crash into a wall or another snake, you\u2019re out. Fortunately, you can <strong>respawn instantly</strong> and jump right back into the action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc0d Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Online multiplayer via Steam Lobby</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Supports mouse, keyboard, and controllers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>One simple, square map where food spawns randomly</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Unlimited speed boost with no cooldown or penalty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Unlockable snake skins to customize your look</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Timed matches or endless free-for-all mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Instant respawn and jump back into the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the current state of the game, and we\u2019re actively working on adding more content and features as we continue development. More maps, skins, and gameplay options will be coming soon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiss &amp; Hunt</strong> is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer snake game with pixel art visuals, where you control a hungry snake in a chaotic arena. Every piece of food you eat makes your snake grow, increasing both your reach and the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>speed boost</strong> to escape danger or grab food before your opponents. There\u2019s no penalty for boosting, so feel free to use it as much as you want! But be cautious: if you crash into a wall or another snake, you\u2019re out. Fortunately, you can <strong>respawn instantly</strong> and jump right back into the action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc0d Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Online multiplayer via Steam Lobby</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Supports mouse, keyboard, and controllers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>One simple, square map where food spawns randomly</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Unlimited speed boost with no cooldown or penalty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Unlockable snake skins to customize your look</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Timed matches or endless free-for-all mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Instant respawn and jump back into the game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the current state of the game, and we\u2019re actively working on adding more content and features as we continue development. More maps, skins, and gameplay options will be coming soon!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into fast-paced 2D snake battles! Boost through chaos, outsmart rivals, and grow to dominate the arena. Instant respawns keep the action non-stop. Easy to learn, hard to master. Do you have what it takes to survive?",
